Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿万能的主 赐予怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Misereatur vestri, omnipotens Deus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.91,0:01:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宽恕汝之罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Et dimissis peccatis vestris omnibus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.38,0:02:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿耶稣基督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perducat vos Jesu Christos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}引领你到达永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}ad vitam aeternam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虔诚的英格兰人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the faithful people of England,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔爵士与红衣主教费施尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}your Holy Father offers you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.19,0:02:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以身殉教\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hand of condolence,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我悲痛不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}his tears of grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心中怒火难以平息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his anger at the martyrdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.90,0:02:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我谨在此哀悼亡灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Sir Thomas More and Cardinal Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的死讯震惊了整个基督教界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their murder has shocked the whole of Christendom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.24,0:02:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}处决二位伟大而高尚之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an unpardonable sin against.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即是对上帝和我们神圣的教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}God and our Holy Church, in whose name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}犯下了不可饶恕的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}these two great and noble men died.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们为那些继续存活于\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pray for those in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰暴政统治下\N{\fnArial\fs30}who must continue to live under tyranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}担惊受怕的人们祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in fear for their lives and for their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们祈祷国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pray the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不再听信谗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}ceases to listen to evil counsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回归正道 信奉真理\N{\fnArial\fs30}and returns to obedience and the true faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在还为时不晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it is too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们向圣母玛利亚祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pray to Marian, Mother of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰能够\N{\fnArial\fs30}that England may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摆脱异端邪教的控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}redeemed from heresy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}异教徒及其种种邪恶行径\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all its evil ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正在引导她走向\N{\fnArial\fs30}and from the clutches of the heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被诅咒的毁灭之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}who even now, are leading her towards destruction and damnation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔治·波林 洛克福特勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}George Boleyn, Lord Rochford,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将与莫尔雷勋爵之女成婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to marry Lord Morley's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.99,0:03:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫尔雷勋爵求见于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Morley came to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他无法满足托马斯·波林阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cannot meet Sir Thomas Boleyn's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}300磅嫁妆的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}demand for a dowry of 300 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我承诺为他补足差额\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assured him that I would make up the shortfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下甚是慷慨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty is most generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对修道院的调查进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is your survey of the religious houses progressing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.78,0:04:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 负责调查的专员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, the Commissioners are currently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前在西南部的修道院进行核查\N{\fnArial\fs30}examining houses in the west country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们向我汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, and elsewhere, they tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在各地修道院皆发现了骇人听闻的罪恶行径\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have uncovered many enormities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么罪恶行径\N{\fnArial\fs30}What enormities?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have found.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修道士和众多修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}the monks and many places.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此堕落 放肆 腐败\N{\fnArial\fs30}so depraved, so licentious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以至于诸位专员\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so corrupt that your commissioners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对理想的改革感到绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}already despair of any perfect reformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}例如 著名的黑尔斯圣血\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example the case of the celebrated Holy Blood of Hailes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理应为圣徒之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposedly the blood of a saint,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用于抚慰那些为寻奇迹而来的朝圣者\N{\fnArial\fs30}used for healing the pilgrims who flock there hoping for a miracle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.05,0:04:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 杯中所盛之物为鸭血\N{\fnArial\fs30}it turns out to be the blood of a duck,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由修道士们定期更换\N{\fnArial\fs30}which the monks renew regularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鸭血…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duck's blood…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 克伦威尔阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mr. Cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你建议我们怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you propose we do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恕我直言 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Your Majesty will forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}私以为应寻求途径宣传\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should be looking for ways to promote.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的新君主制\N{\fnArial\fs30}your Majesty's New Monarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.97,0:05:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有何高见\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可通过排演戏剧达成目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way would be through the production of plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何以见得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why plays?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}戏剧是阐明政见的最佳方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plays are an ideal way of setting forth,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将罗马派别的主教们可憎\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the people's eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶的面目 告白于天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}the abomination and wickedness of the Bishop of Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同时 向民众传达\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're also a means to demonstrate to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论是依据宗教还是世俗的法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}the obedience that as subjects they owe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臣民都理当服从于国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}by God's and man's laws, to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 我将戏剧的资金筹措和排演事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, I leave it to you, Mr. Secretary,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交由你处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}to finance and produce some plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须竭尽所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must do all we can…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}推动改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}to advance our revolution…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我即将从容就死\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I shall now suffer death in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.72,0:06:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殉教于神圣的天主教会的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the faith of the Holy Catholic Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 大臣阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord. - Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然勋爵大人对改革充满热情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since Your Lordship makes no secret of your zeal for reform,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也迫不及待地向你汇报改革的进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were anxious to let you know our progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下已告知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Grace has just informed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.51,0:06:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在坎特伯雷大教堂设立新职位\N{\fnArial\fs30}of an important new appointment at Canterbury Cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确 西蒙·海斯博士已被任命为新教长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed. Dr. Simon Heyes has been made our new Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海斯博士对圣像画甚感厌恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Heyes particularly detests the cult images.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}决意将它们从大教堂铲除\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is determined to removed them from the Cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时引入新学\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as introducing the new learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将改革派安置于教会其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's vital that we place reformers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤为重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}in positions of responsibility inside the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}费施尔及莫尔自私的殉教行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's bound to be a reaction to the.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}定会引起风波\N{\fnArial\fs30}self-serving martyrdoms of Fisher and More.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此需要告诫臣民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I'm letting it be known, throughout the Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若听到朋友或邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if anyone hears a friend or a neighbor,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对国王及其婚姻或是改革发表评论\N{\fnArial\fs30}criticizing the King or his marriage or the reforms,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们有义务揭发不敬之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have a duty to report it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同时 克伦威尔阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the same time, Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.47,0:07:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有义务宣传正面消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have a duty to spread the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新君主制的实质在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the New Monarchy is about anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it is about liberty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}破除旧迷信 摆脱恐惧和罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liberty from old superstitions, from fear and guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}引领我们从黑暗走向光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… we are moving, my friends, from darkness into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我深有同感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in agreement with Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.99,0:07:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸运的是 我们拥有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately, we have a new weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.35,0:07:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}推广理念的新利器\N{\fnArial\fs30}to promote our ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的上帝 此为何物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my Lord! What in God's name is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.93,0:07:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这叫印刷机 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a printing press, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它将改变世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it will change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.41,0:08:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking of?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}容妾身向您禀明\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您知道国外有很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there are many people abroad,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许国内也有这样一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and perhaps even some within this Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仍然质疑我们女儿的正统地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}who still question the legitimacy of our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确有其事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.51,0:08:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们得有所作为来改变这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is something we can do to change everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Elizabeth was betrothed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与法兰西斯国王最小的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}to King Francis's youngest son,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昂古莱姆公爵联姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Duke of Angouleme,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么她的正统地位将不再\N{\fnArial\fs30}then her legitimacy and station would no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遭到质疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}be questioned by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所言极是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已有所考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have already thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会召见法国大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will speak to the French Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今夜您是否会临幸于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you come to my bed tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 留在宫庭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Come and stay at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我需要你 - 去转告他们 我不会签署的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need you. - I'm not going to sign it! Go and tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}民众会以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are going to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰国王朝令夕改\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King of England is easily changeable!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道国王就得令人畏惧三分？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it better for a King to be feared?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无意担任大法官一职\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是被人爱戴？按我的旨意行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or loved? You will do as I command!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.35,0:09:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈利 哈利 我来此递交我的辞呈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry. Harry. I come to offer my resignation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.37,0:09:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}称呼我哈利的时代已不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time for Harry is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿意解除你的职务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I discharge you most willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的头 将被砍下 你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head, cut off. Your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将被分成四部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be divided in four parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.43,0:11:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我改变主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.47,0:11:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个女人在这时都会有点胆怯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every woman has a moment of faintheartedness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.61,0:11:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要嫁给一个大家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are marrying into a great family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.57,0:11:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论你喜不喜欢 这婚都得结 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will do it, whether you like it or not. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向全能的主祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benedicto Dei, omnipotentis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.05,0:12:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣父 圣子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patris et Filii.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣灵…\N{\fnArial\fs30}et Spiritus sancti…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老实点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各位同胞 今天我们齐聚一堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brethren, we are gathered here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.75,0:12:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下 亨利·诺里斯爵士觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, Sir Henry Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 国王陛下 - 有什么能帮忙的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许国王陛下也听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well as Your Majesty may know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我最近成了鳏夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recently became a widower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 我自然想要续弦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, naturally, I am looking to wed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我心仪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my choice has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正巧是王后陛下的侍女之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon one of Her Majesty's ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谁？- 玛格丽特·谢尔登女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Lady Margaret Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是说玛琪 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean Madge! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道和她很熟的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I believe some people call her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这么称呼她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they are familiar with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你向谢尔登女士表白了吗 亨利爵士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you made your intentions plain to Miss Sheldon, Sir Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还没有陛下 目前\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Your Majesty. I have merely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还只是单方面的爱慕\N{\fnArial\fs30}admired her from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在我想有更进一步的发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I would now like to take things further.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果陛下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Your Majesty can think of no…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不反对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}impediment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 一点也不反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. None.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恩准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们相识已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have known you a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有人比你更为诚实 受人尊敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could not think of a more honest nor a more honorable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am deeply grateful to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.07,0:13:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国大使阁下觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Excellency the French Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 阁下好 - 国王陛下想要见我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excellency. - Your Majesty wanted to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想问候一下我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to ask after my brother, the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:13:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty is very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了对皇帝的憎恶之心不减\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for his hatred of the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这成了他的心病 - 那么他仍希望我们维持旧好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- which is like a disease. - So he still wants our friendship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的上帝 您是世上他最爱戴的王公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mon Dieu! He loves you above all the princes in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我想向他提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then make to him this proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的儿子查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}that his son Charles,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昂古莱姆公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke of Angouleme,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与我深爱的女儿 伊丽莎白订婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be betrothed to our beloved daughter, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.45,0:14:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简·帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫尔雷勋爵的女儿 他是国王的远房表亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Morley's daughter. He's a distant cousin of the King…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她是个女孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.44,0:15:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么好笑的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真的爱我吗 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do love me, don't you, George?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然是真的 我娶了你不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I love you. I married you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常期待今晚的来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I can't wait for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎么了？- 没事 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Nothing. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失陪一下 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very pretty,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.37,0:17:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}漂亮的简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.37,0:17:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求求你了 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.39,0:18:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你不要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们来讨论些其他事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us go about our other matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于约翰国王对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now as much as King John.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神圣教会的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}does Holy Church so handle,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将用十字架 书本\N{\fnArial\fs30}so here I curse him with cross,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铃铛和蜡烛 诅咒于他\N{\fnArial\fs30}book, bell and candle…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将恳请上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will ask God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收回照耀他的永恒圣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put him from His eternal light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将把他带离耶稣的身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take him from Christ,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这铃声之后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and after the sound of this bell…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.58,0:19:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铃声 你这傻小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bell, you buggers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:20:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铃声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.37,0:20:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这铃声之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after the sound of this bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.09,0:20:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说之后 在这铃声之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said after the sound of this bell…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的躯体和灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both body and soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都将被送给地狱的魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give him to the devil in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 同时… - 这出戏真不错 大臣阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And meanwhile… - This is a fine piece of work, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.89,0:20:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很有教育意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}And educative.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁写的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder who wrote it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mr. Bale.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他曾是旧教的牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was once a priest of the old faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.70,0:20:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但看清了历史趋势之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}but seeing how things went on,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就化身为积极的改革者\N{\fnArial\fs30}became a most passionate reformer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.33,0:20:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 我们家族最引以为豪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think our family never did anything better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.57,0:20:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫过于协助您\N{\fnArial\fs30}than facilitate and encourage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.27,0:20:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}支持您的高升 大臣阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your own rise, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也相信 您不会忘了我们为您做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I trust you never forget that we did so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:20:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bishops,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将会赚进大笔大笔的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}will make lots and lots of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱教皇 一生挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the Pope, as much as I ever may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.60,0:21:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真诚地向你请教 这是为什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray thee heartily, tell me why you do so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.73,0:21:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我悟性好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I perceive well,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.74,0:21:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇他喜欢吹大牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Pope is a jolly fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.74,0:21:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}文质绉绉 富得流油\N{\fnArial\fs30}A trim fellow, a rich fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像个讨喜的小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and a merry fellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他大权握在手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's rich in his royalty…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.48,0:21:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信徒们全成了他的哈巴狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and angelic to his behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.43,0:21:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和法国大使谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've talked to the French Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.00,0:21:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法兰西海军元帅被任命来筹备这次订婚仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francis is sending the Admiral of France to arrange the marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.29,0:21:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.84,0:22:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两位陛下好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesties.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.60,0:22:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法兰西海军元帅即将造访我国\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Admiral of France is to pay an official visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.15,0:22:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你以我之名招待他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to receive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.69,0:22:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要让他觉得宾至如归\N{\fnArial\fs30}and entertain him on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.45,0:22:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么是他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.63,0:22:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我的父亲才是更合适的人选吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely my father would be a much better choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.67,0:22:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信大人您能办好这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust Your Grace to carry out my commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.97,0:22:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将一直是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, as ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您最忠诚谦卑的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty's humble and obedient servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多此一举\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.95,0:22:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他恨我 - 但他爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He hates me. - But he loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.02,0:22:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然是用拉丁文写的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As they're in latin…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.30,0:22:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人会懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no man can know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.41,0:22:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.83,0:22:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个娼妓\N{\fnArial\fs30}That woman is a whore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她对我简直连我对狗还不如\N{\fnArial\fs30}She treats me worse than I treat my dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你的狗会反咬一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then your dogs bite back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.14,0:23:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果典礼和迷信将从我们这里消亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}If ceremonies and superstitions from us fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.04,0:23:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 和僧侣 教规\N{\fnArial\fs30}then farewell monks and canons,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.01,0:23:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牧师 修道士 主教…\N{\fnArial\fs30}priest, friar, bishop…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.45,0:23:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切的一切都道别吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ALL.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.82,0:23:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳王后怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is Queen Katherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.56,0:23:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她身体欠安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas she is very unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}病情不断恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is sinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.33,0:23:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的日常开销不仅大大被削减\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only is her household severely reduced,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还被禁止与亲生女儿相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she has been separated from her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.47,0:23:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 长达4年 - 这太残忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- for the last 4 years. - That is very cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她的信念是坚定不移的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But her faith is astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那玛丽小姐呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Lady Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.35,0:23:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要那个情妇还掌权\N{\fnArial\fs30}While the concubine has power,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.29,0:23:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我担心她性命不保\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear for her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.54,0:23:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为国家的安康\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the comfort of this nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.03,0:24:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请为我们祈求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precibus et meritis beatae.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.63,0:24:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣母玛利亚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mariae semper Virginis…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.16,0:25:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽小姐 您抱着伊丽莎白公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary. What in heaven's name are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.27,0:25:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有何企图？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the Princess Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.78,0:25:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她被独自丢在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.18,0:25:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来抱抱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.78,0:25:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把她给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.06,0:25:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把她一个人撇下 你个蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left her alone. You little fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.53,0:25:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们品着酒 缅怀那些离我们远去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sup and think of those who are no longer with us:
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.30,0:25:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为莫尔和费施尔等诸多忠义之士干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To More and to Fisher, those martyred men.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.54,0:25:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿上帝保佑他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.18,0:25:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am told that many who.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.02,0:26:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多最初支持国王推行改革的人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}initially supported the King's reforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.22,0:26:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在都颇有微词\N{\fnArial\fs30}are now forming a different opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.63,0:26:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多忠义之士的遇害\N{\fnArial\fs30}The terrible murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.09,0:26:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终于让大家觉醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of honest and faithful men has opened many eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.10,0:26:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我仍然不会归罪于国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still do not blame the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.86,0:26:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被巫术迷惑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been seduced by witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.93,0:26:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always believed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.10,0:26:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 现在我证据在握了 - 你有证据？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and now I have proof. - You have proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.10,0:26:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.44,0:26:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和安妮的一位侍女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have befriended.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.71,0:26:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交情甚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}a maid of Anne's bedchamber,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.60,0:26:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她告诉我那个贱人藏着一个惊天的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has told me that the harlot hides a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.76,0:26:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个畸形人 乔普斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's deformed Chapuys,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.55,0:26:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}左手多长了片指甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}an extra fingernail on her left hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.52,0:26:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了隐藏它 她痛苦不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}which she is always at great pains to conceal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.62,0:26:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的身上长满了痣\N{\fnArial\fs30}As well her body is covered in moles,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.00,0:26:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 这便是恶魔之刻印\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is sometimes called, the Devil's Teats as you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.98,0:26:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个侍女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.91,0:26:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向我发誓 她在安妮裸露的皮肤上\N{\fnArial\fs30}she swore to me honestly that she had seen these quite plainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.20,0:26:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}清清楚楚地看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}on Anne's naked skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.30,0:26:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管她一直在试图掩盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though the lady constantly seeks to cover herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.31,0:26:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.06,0:26:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事当真？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it so?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.54,0:27:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's is truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.81,0:27:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以她必须得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why she must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.73,0:27:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.30,0:27:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的风流韵事层出不穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's having more affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.51,0:27:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.50,0:27:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当然肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.00,0:28:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我经常找不到他 没人会透露他的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Often I can't find him. No one will tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.98,0:28:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 他出宫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He leaves the palace. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.48,0:28:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时他一走就是好几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone for hours sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.49,0:28:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他可能在别处另设后宫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's got a harem somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.78,0:28:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可以在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a place where he keeps his harem,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.17,0:28:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金屋藏娇 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he keeps his women. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.40,0:28:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.90,0:28:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要大难临头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's going to happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.53,0:28:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 - 你知道那个预言\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - You know there's a prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.60,0:28:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人人都知道 预言说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knows it. The prophecy says.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.71,0:28:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一位英格兰王后将会被烈火焚烧而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Queen of England will be burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.31,0:28:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别胡思乱想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.38,0:28:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定会平安无事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is going to happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.54,0:28:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没能为国王生个太子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm unable to give a King a son;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.89,0:28:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.42,0:28:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传承其父亲的血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be the living image of his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.47,0:28:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 一定会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. Everything is going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.80,0:28:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.86,0:29:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.37,0:29:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓 我会照顾你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll look after you, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.84,0:29:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托别哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.15,0:29:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.89,0:29:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大臣阁下 这些是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary. What are all these?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.06,0:29:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}启奏书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denunciations.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.15,0:29:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据报在图克斯伯利的一位教士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is reported that a canon at Tewksbury,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.26,0:29:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知有意或是无意的为凯瑟琳王后祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}mistakenly or otherwise, offered prayers to Katherine the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.80,0:29:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而非安妮王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.19,0:29:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他所辖教会中 有七人呈供了上述逆词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven of his congregation reported these words.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.48,0:29:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你准备怎么处置他 - 我什么都不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What will you do to him? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.19,0:29:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已年逾古稀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's near 80 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.28,0:29:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这纯粹是一种无意识的口误\N{\fnArial\fs30}An absent-minded slip of the tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.68,0:29:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于这样一个老人 实在是情有可原\N{\fnArial\fs30}in such an old man is perfectly forgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.82,0:29:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他的一些案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of these others.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.36,0:30:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}涉及问题则更加严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}are much more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.83,0:30:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at these.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.50,0:30:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些小册子是在颂扬国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tracts praising His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.41,0:30:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}及其新君主制和他所倡导的改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his New Monarchy and the reformation they explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.49,0:30:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解释了改革的必要性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the reformation is necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.58,0:30:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及改革为国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the liberties and the opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.38,0:30:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卑微的臣民所带来的自由和机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would be bringing to the King's humblest subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.92,0:30:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令人深思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.02,0:30:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大臣阁下 您的成就值得庆贺啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to be congratulated on your industry, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.09,0:30:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过难道你就丝毫不担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But does it never concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.90,0:30:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王权力过大\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the King has taken to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.49,0:30:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不受制约\N{\fnArial\fs30}an absolute power,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.39,0:30:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从而导致重修宪法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}without any constraint, to remake the law?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.20,0:30:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让国王高兴的不就是… 重订宪法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is not that which pleases the King… the law?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我 我只是随便说说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was… I was only observing…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.65,0:31:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怀特阁下 我很欣赏你 我喜欢与你共商国事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you, Mr. Wyatt, and enjoy your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.05,0:31:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 听闻阁下吃喝嫖赌无一不精\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have a reputation:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.95,0:31:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你臭名远扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gamble and you whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.57,0:31:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你善于见风使舵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sail close to the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.15,0:31:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苍天不容\N{\fnArial\fs30}God forbid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.20,0:31:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你理应触礁而亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should ever blow you onto the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.48,0:31:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法兰西海军元帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Excellency Philippe Chabot de Brion,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.48,0:31:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布里昂的菲利浦·夏博阁下驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral of France.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.42,0:31:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 在下是夏博元帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace. - Admiral Chabot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.45,0:31:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本人万分荣幸地欢迎您以及随从人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my privilege and pleasure to welcome you and your party.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.96,0:31:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到访英格兰 光临此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}to my home and to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.06,0:31:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我向您引见内人 公爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I present my wife, the Duchess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.09,0:31:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能一睹夫人风采 实在是荣幸之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame. Je suis ravi de vous connaître.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.93,0:31:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, with your permission,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.51,0:31:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向你引见我的秘书埃尔阿尔封斯·贡蒂哀先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}may I present my Secretary, Monsieur Alfonse Gontier…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.10,0:31:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Madame. - Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.50,0:31:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是我的侄女 杰曼尼小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my niece, Mademoiselle Germaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.20,0:31:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰曼尼小姐 您实在是太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mademoiselle. You are very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.37,0:32:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame. Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.65,0:32:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 能否告诉我 接下来有何安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me, your Grace, what are we to expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.93,0:32:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里先由我来招待您及各位随从人员几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am to entertain you and your staff here for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.39,0:32:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随后国王陛下会在皇宫设宴款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the King invites you to dine at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.89,0:32:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 很好 - 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very good. - There is one other thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.46,0:32:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被告知 安妮王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am told that Queen Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.98,0:32:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特意为您安排了一个宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}has planned a banquet in your honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.93,0:32:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和一场网球赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a tennis match.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.01,0:32:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you met Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.80,0:32:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您在加来见过王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}once before, in Calais,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.48,0:32:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时她还未加冕 陪行伴驾于国王左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she accompanied His Majesty before her coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.24,0:32:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许吧 不过我不记得有这么一次会面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have. But I have no recollection of any such meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.72,0:32:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 很遗憾 我不打网球\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, alas, I don't play tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.26,0:32:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.74,0:32:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早安 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morrow, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.51,0:32:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.00,0:32:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你要去哪 - 出宫去 - 哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Out. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.07,0:33:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.62,0:33:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要去哪 快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going? I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.80,0:33:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与你何干\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.38,0:33:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我倒希望你马上进宫去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my pleasure that you go back inside. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.12,0:33:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.92,0:35:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.79,0:35:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢你 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you, Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.79,0:35:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你机智过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.36,0:35:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不喜欢你们皇帝的待人态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't like the way your Emperor treats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.43,0:35:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就凯瑟琳而论 他似乎认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems to think that, as far as Katherine is concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.56,0:35:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是我在泄私愤\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I act out of spite,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是我心肠歹毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that I am being malicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.27,0:35:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我发誓 绝对不是那么一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I swear it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.00,0:35:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得 我应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose I ought.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.05,0:35:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心满意足了 因为我知道世人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be content in the knowledge that the world knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.74,0:35:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白我受了多少的诬陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}the many wrongs that have been done to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.28,0:36:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 你不赞成我在王国内推行的改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't approve of the changes I'm making in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.79,0:36:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔截获了一些你的信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cromwell intercepts some of your letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.54,0:36:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去我们常把它叫做 人道主义\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to call it Humanism.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.32,0:36:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我 渥西和莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolsey, More and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.95,0:36:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都是人道主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all Humanists.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.20,0:36:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多人都觉得我变了 可我一点都没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people think I've changed, but I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.30,0:36:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在内心深处 我依然是个人道主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}At heart I'm still a Humanist.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.57,0:36:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔普斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chapuys,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.99,0:36:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.95,0:36:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我即将在国内推行的改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I am going to make such a reformation in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.35,0:36:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将会使我在基督教界\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I shall be remembered eternally.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.55,0:36:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永垂不朽\N{\fnArial\fs30}throughout all Christendom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.79,0:36:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我丝毫不怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no doubt whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.16,0:36:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的统治无论如何都将永被铭记\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Your Majesty's reign will always be remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.84,0:36:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为他准备了一场盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had planned a banquet in his honor…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.31,0:36:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谁？- 法国海军元帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - The French Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.74,0:37:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他来了2个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been here for 2 weeks already,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.53,0:37:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却只和沙福克公爵呆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}staying with the Duke of Suffolk,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.13,0:37:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至连个问安的口信都没送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he has not yet sent me a message of goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何其他法国使节都会来问安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every other French envoy has always done so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.86,0:37:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也没有请求觐见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither has he requested an audience with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.32,0:37:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}觐见我 堂堂英格兰王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me, the Queen of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.23,0:37:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他此行目的正是来商讨我女儿的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when we are discussing the future of my own child.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.91,0:37:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下该就寝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty should rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.84,0:37:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我该告退了 - 据说他还和\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I ought to leave you…- They also tell me he has struck up an acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.92,0:37:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝的大使乔普斯暗通款曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the Imperial Ambassador, Chapuys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.67,0:37:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这真是太不寻常了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that not extraordinary?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.30,0:37:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说 他怎能如此？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why should he do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.35,0:37:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为何一声不吭 马克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you not say anything, Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.91,0:37:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请陛下宽恕 我不知该说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty must forgive me.I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.93,0:37:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些事情我不胜置评\N{\fnArial\fs30}These matters are beyond my competence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.59,0:37:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是个舞师\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I? Only a dancing-master.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.56,0:37:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更有甚者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's something else:
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.86,0:37:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人 可能是个恨我的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone, some bitch who probably hates me…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.50,0:37:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我说国王特意安排了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told me that the King has deliberately invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.60,0:37:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多漂亮女人进宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lot of beautiful women to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.57,0:37:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以迎接元帅的来访\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Admiral's visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.64,0:38:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能相信吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean can you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.91,0:38:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 公爵大人 - 国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.16,0:38:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请容我为你引见\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I present his Excellency,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.06,0:38:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国海军元帅 布里昂的菲利浦·夏博阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philippe Chabot de Brion, the Admiral of France.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.19,0:38:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 参见陛下 - 欢迎光临我的王宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Welcome to my court.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.20,0:38:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请让我介绍我的妻子 安妮王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce my wife, Queen Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.65,0:38:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.61,0:38:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请 我们入席吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let us be seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来点葡萄酒吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.97,0:39:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 当然 - 是哪个地区的酒？波尔多的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Which domain does it come from? Is it Bordeaux?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.22,0:39:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是英国酒 - 英国酒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is English wine. - English wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.65,0:39:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国从罗马时代起就开始酿酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been making wine in England since the Romans.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.05,0:39:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}光阴短暂如斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}As recently as that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.90,0:39:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Très bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.87,0:39:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果香浓郁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very fruity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.88,0:39:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很烈 像是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And strong. Like a…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.14,0:39:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}角斗士的汗水 （春药）\N{\fnArial\fs30}gladiator's sweats! Ha! Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.80,0:40:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位先生是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.09,0:40:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的秘书 贡蒂哀先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My secretary, Monsieur Gontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.61,0:40:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想把他介绍给我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like to introduce him to my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.33,0:40:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.86,0:40:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴认识您 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enchanté, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.29,0:40:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesté…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.64,0:40:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 请您宽恕我未能出席\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty must forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.92,0:40:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您为我举办的盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}for not being able to attend the banquet you arranged in my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.88,0:40:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很不巧 但沙克福公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was most unfortunate, but His Grace the Duke of Suffolk,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.23,0:40:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和他那迷人的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his charming wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.86,0:40:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我深陷他们的庄园之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}have kept me a virtual prisoner in their castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.92,0:40:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我… 怎么说好呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was… how shall I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.96,0:41:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盛情款待无法脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imprisoned by affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.06,0:41:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人？我说话惹您见笑了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame? Are you amusing yourself at my expense?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.64,0:41:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.93,0:41:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我实在忍不住笑出声来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could not help laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.48,0:41:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾王本欲介绍你的秘书给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the King's proposition of introducing your secretary to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.94,0:41:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却在见到他时\N{\fnArial\fs30}For whilst he was finding him,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.40,0:41:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因遇到漂亮女士而全然忘掉初衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}he met that pretty lady, and forgot the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.91,0:41:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}言归正传吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk some business.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.96,0:42:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你主人如何交代给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What instructions do you have from your master,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.99,0:42:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我女儿伊丽莎白与昂古莱姆公爵的联姻事宜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with regard to the betrothal of my daughter Elizabeth to the Duke of Angouleme?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.29,0:42:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下他很遗憾 此项提亲不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty regrets that such a proposition is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.07,0:42:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何「不可能」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why "impossible"?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.58,0:42:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然他深爱陛下 但国王无法同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much as he loves Your Majesty, the King cannot agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.84,0:42:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他心爱的儿子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to betroth his beloved son to a…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.88,0:42:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迎娶其合法地位未得到保禄教皇陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a bride whose legitimacy is not accepted by his Holiness Pope Paul,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.72,0:42:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}及神圣教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Holy Church itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.56,0:42:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至于神圣罗马皇帝认可的新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor even by the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.69,0:42:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 吾王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, His Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.19,0:42:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为示亲善 另行提婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}to demonstrate his love, proposes another match.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.93,0:42:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他将应允法王太子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would consent to the betrothal of the Dauphin…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.69,0:42:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与你合法的女儿玛丽女士的婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Lady Mary, your legitimate daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.71,0:43:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果您不同意这桩婚事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do not agree to the match, my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.08,0:43:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我主人便会让王太子迎娶神圣罗马皇帝之女\N{\fnArial\fs30}will marry his son to the Emperor's daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.40,0:43:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将会使贵国孤立于欧洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving your country isolated in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.53,0:43:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下 您与陛下的会面结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellence, your audience with His Majesty is now over.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.14,0:43:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.95,0:43:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有任何借口 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no excuses, Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.93,0:43:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原以为那种日子已经离我而去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought those days were behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.96,0:44:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许本性难移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps human nature can never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.14,0:44:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓 绝不再发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to you it will never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.20,0:44:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我太爱你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.25,0:44:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无权请你相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no right to ask you to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.15,0:44:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.85,0:44:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.89,0:44:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你毕竟还是令我落泪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you did make me cry, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.19,0:45:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.26,0:45:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你指谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was who?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.84,0:45:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你去找贡蒂哀先生时\N{\fnArial\fs30}That lady you were talking to,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.59,0:45:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你与她谈话的那个女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you were supposed to be finding Monsieur Gontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.37,0:45:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.87,0:45:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你的情妇之一吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she one of your mistresses?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.03,0:45:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有多少情妇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.54,0:45:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are their names?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.62,0:45:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把她们都安置在何处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you keep them?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.85,0:45:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人密报我 你的那些贵族们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone told me that your nobles,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.47,0:45:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像布兰顿之流 一直在帮你沾花惹草\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Brandon, are assisting you in having your affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.10,0:45:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就此打住吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.94,0:45:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.62,0:45:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你告诉我 你总是告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You told me… you always told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.58,0:45:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们该彼此诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we should be truthful with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.89,0:45:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说这是爱的真谛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it was the definition of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.25,0:46:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我来告诉你真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then here's the truth:
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.35,0:46:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最好闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must shut your eyes and endure…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.92,0:46:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像你的前任对你一样忍受下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}like your betters have done before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.82,0:46:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎能跟我这么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you say that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.41,0:46:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你难道不知道我爱你强过凯瑟琳千倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know that I love you a thousand times more than Katherine ever did!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.99,0:46:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你难道不知道 我可以迅速把让你捧上天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't you know that I can drag you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.47,0:46:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也可以立刻把你拉下马\N{\fnArial\fs30}as quickly as I raised you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.18,0:46:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该庆幸你还有张床 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is lucky you have your bed already, madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.87,0:46:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为如果你没有 我便不会再给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because if you did not, I wouldn't give it to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.28,0:46:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗兰西斯不接受婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francis won't accept to the betrothal.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.38,0:46:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么？- 你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Why do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.09,0:46:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为教皇 他还有神圣罗马皇帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the Pope and he and the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.55,0:46:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全都认为她是私生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}all agree she's a bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.90,0:46:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全都认为你并非我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are not my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.86,0:47:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 你的凯瑟琳近来如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me: how's your Catherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.13,0:47:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.61,0:47:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 她怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact… she's with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.54,0:47:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是个幸福的已婚男人 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! You're a happily married man, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.11,0:47:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我徒有健羡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.66,0:47:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为天体是否影响我们的生活？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think the planets influence our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.33,0:47:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.97,0:47:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我过去经常与莫尔谈论这方面问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would often discuss the issue with More.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.79,0:47:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在夜里我们会站在屋顶上 揣摸天际\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would stand on the roof at nights, and study the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.69,0:47:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫尔对星空知识甚为熟捻\N{\fnArial\fs30}More had a great knowledge of the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.16,0:47:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也了解它们如何影响我们的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how they influence our…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.70,0:47:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心态\N{\fnArial\fs30}humors.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.48,0:48:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我为莫尔所发生的一切感到悔恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret now what happened to More.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.78,0:48:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时甚至企盼它从未发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}In some ways I wish it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.79,0:48:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这并非都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.73,0:48:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每当我打消决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever my resolve weakened,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.55,0:48:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每当我心生救他之念\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever I was inclined to save him…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.74,0:48:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个人便会私下\N{\fnArial\fs30}a certain person would privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.67,0:48:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逼迫我加紧他的毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}urged me on to his destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.35,0:48:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何许人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.90,0:48:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知她是谁 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who she is, Charles.
